wg-asf-job-supervisors-council = the Federation council
wg-asf-job-supervisors-envoy = the Envoy
wg-asf-job-envoy = ASF Envoy
wg-asf-job-envoy-description = Runs Lantern Post and speaks for the Federation.
wg-asf-job-field-researcher = ASF Field Researcher
wg-asf-job-field-researcher-description = Takes survey ships out, studies what they find and brings the data back to the lab.
wg-asf-job-colonist = ASF Colonist
wg-asf-job-colonist-description = Keeps the post running and looks for expansion opportunities.
wg-asf-job-enforcer = ASF Enforcer
wg-asf-job-enforcer-description = Keeps the post and ASF members safe.

wg-asf-lantern-subtext = A mobile outpost run by the ASF.
wg-asf-lantern-description = Lantern Post is the ASF's base ship in the sector. Visitors can use the clinic, garden and cargo bay, and members also get a shipyard, an R&D lab and a farm. Not a combat faction, though the post can defend itself.

ent-WGAsfEncryptionKey = ASF encryption key
    .desc = An encryption key for the ASF channel.
ent-WGAsfClothingHeadset = ASF headset
    .desc = A standard headset for ASF personnel. This headset will accept standard encryption keys and comes prefitted with a key for the ASF channel.
ent-WGAsfAirlock = ASF airlock
ent-WGAsfAirlockGlass = ASF glass airlock
ent-WGAsfAirlockCommand = ASF command airlock
ent-WGAsfAirlockBridge = ASF bridge airlock
ent-WGAsfAirlockSecurity = ASF security airlock
ent-WGAsfLockerSecurity = ASF security locker
    .desc = A locker for Enforcer gear. Needs ASF security access.
ent-WGAsfVoucherCivilian = ASF civilian LPC
    .desc = A small card that authorizes the procurement of one ASF Gleaner, Porter or Lamplighter. Redeemable at an ASF shipyard console. Destroyed on use.
ent-WGAsfVoucherEscort = ASFN escort LPC
    .desc = A small card that authorizes the procurement of one ASFN Vigil or Bulwark. Redeemable at an ASF shipyard console. Destroyed on use.
ent-WGAsfVoucherLodestar = ASFN Lodestar LPC
    .desc = A small card that authorizes the procurement of an ASFN Lodestar-class frigate. Lodestars can't be bought with thalers. Destroyed on use.
ent-WGAsfShieldGenerator = FS-421V "Bastion" Outpost Shield Generator
    .desc = The Bastion. An FS-421 retuned by the Federation to project a violet field. Same durability, same appetite for power.
ent-WGAsfResearchServer = ASF R&D server
    .desc = Stores Lantern Post's research, ship LPC designs included.
ent-WGAsfLathe = ASF fabricator
    .desc = Prints ASF ship LPCs, coilguns, field modsuits and shipgun ammo from researched designs.

